{"text": "You are going to have to do what is best for you, even when it hurts.\n\nHear this carefully, my friend. What you tolerate becomes your future. When someone shows you they do not care, believe them. When they pull you close and then go cold, that is not confusion. That is your answer.\n\nThere are times when love is holding on. There are times when the strongest thing a person can do is walk away.\n\nYes, it will hurt. The bond was real. Your heart was real. But you cannot keep letting an unhealed person stand on your spirit and then wonder why you feel small. This is the moment you choose yourself, even with your hands shaking.\n\nComment chosen, and I will send you the first step.\n\nAnd understand this. Walking away is one day. Staying gone, on the night you are lonely and your thumb is over their name, is the practice. Everything I know is inside The Quiet Between Thoughts. The link is in my profile.", "alignment": {"characters": ["Y", "o", "u", " ", "a", "r", "e", " ", "g", "o", "i", "n", "g", " ", "t", "o", " ", "h", "a", "v", "e", " ", "t", "o", " ", "d", "o", " ", "w", "h", "a", "t", " ", "i", "s", " ", "b", "e", "s", "t", " ", "f", "o", "r", " ", "y", "o", "u", ",", " ", "e", "v", "e", "n", " ", "w", "h", "e", "n", " ", "i", "t", " ", "h", "u", "r", "t", "s", ".", "\n", "\n", "H", "e", "a", "r", " ", "t", "h", "i", "s", " ", "c", "a", "r", "e", "f", "u", "l", "l", "y", ",", " ", "m", "y", " ", "f", "r", "i", "e", "n", "d", ".", " ", "W", "h", "a", "t", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "t", "o", "l", "e", "r", "a", "t", "e", " ", "b", "e", "c", "o", "m", "e", "s", " ", "y", "o", "u", "r", " ", "f", "u", "t", "u", "r", "e", ".", " ", "W", "h", "e", "n", " ", "s", "o", "m", "e", "o", "n", "e", " ", "s", "h", "o", "w", "s", " ", "y", "o", "u", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", " ", "d", "o", " ", "n", "o", "t", " ", "c", "a", "r", "e", ",", " ", "b", "e", "l", "i", "e", "v", "e", " ", "t", "h", "e", "m", ".", " ", "W", "h", "e", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", " ", "p",